Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:17.64,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,EPISODE 8: TIDAK ADA LAGI KEBOHONGAN
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:42.39,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,DI DOJO SEPULANG SEKOLAH
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.39,0:05:44.14,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,DATANGLAH DENGAN SERAGAM KENDO.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.03,0:05:49.70,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,DATANGLAH DENGAN SERAGAM KENDO.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika aku rajin belajar, apakah itu\Nakan menguntungkan Keluarga Tennoji?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, tentu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika aku jadi orang terpandang, apa itu juga\Nakan menguntungkan Keluarga Tennoji?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.91,0:00:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerja yang bagus, Mirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.77,0:00:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu juga sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana menurutmu tentang dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian berdua sepertinya\Nsangat menikmati obrolannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.57,0:00:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba kupikirkan...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.94,0:00:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tampak seperti pria\Nyang baik dan cerdas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.45,0:00:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang pilihan Ayah dan Ibu\Nmemang luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:01:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, kami cuma ingin kau bahagia, Mirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, pria itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana mengatakannya, ya?\NDia terkesan sangat bijak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tata kramanya pun sempurna,\Nlayaknya pewaris perusahaan raksasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh? Memangnya ada yang salah dengan itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan berarti aku bilang itu salah, sih...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, saat berhadapan\Ndengan orang sesempurna dia,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.97,0:01:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tak ada hal yang bisa kuajarkan padanya,\Natau kukhawatirkan tentangnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, bagaimana perbandingannya\Ndengan Tomonari?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.34,0:01:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke-Kenapa Ibu membahas Tomonari sekarang?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.95,0:01:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, Ibu cuma penasaran saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.72,0:01:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tomonari masih punya banyak kekurangan,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan ada begitu banyak hal\Nyang harus kuajarkan kepadanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setiap kali menemaninya makan,\Naku selalu dibuat waswas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.11,0:02:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, jadi dia itu tipe idamanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.87,0:02:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh ya, bisnis apa yang sebenarnya\Ndijalankan keluarga Tomonari?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.43,0:02:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perusahaan IT di bawah naungan Grup Konohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia akan mewarisinya suatu hari nanti?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pantas saja dia kelihatan\Nsangat merakyat, atau sederhana, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong rahasiakan ini,\Ntapi dia itu anak angkat, sama sepertiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti itu alasannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.18,0:02:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudmu, Tomonari diadopsi\Nuntuk dijadikan penerus?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.58,0:02:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, kurasa begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.89,0:02:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aneh sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.53,0:02:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perusahaan IT milik Grup Konohana\Nsedang mencari penerus?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu tak pernah dengar gosip soal itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.71,0:02:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rich Girl Caretaker:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I'm Secretly the Caregiver of the\NMost Popular Girl in This Rich Kid School
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.64,0:04:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pagi yang sama seperti biasanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.95,0:04:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako, jangan tidur sambil jalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahaya, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.35,0:04:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau pulang...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita baru saja keluar dari rumah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada penyusup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada tanda-tanda mencurigakan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk berjaga-jaga,\Nterus pantau area sekitar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dimengerti.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku cuma berhalusinasi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau baru saja teriak, "Ada penyusup!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasa ada yang mengawasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau bukan halusinasi,\Npasti pelakunya sangat lihai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ucapan Shizune tadi lumayan bikin merinding,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi selain itu,\Nrutinitasku akan segera dimulai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sembari menunggu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.31,0:05:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Surat cinta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.99,0:05:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, tidak mungkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akademi ini isinya para calon\NCEO perusahaan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.23,0:05:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mana mungkin ada yang mengirimiku...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Surat tantangan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa maksudnya ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tulisan tangan ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.62,0:06:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata benar-benar kau, Tennoji?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku datang pakai seragam ini\Nseperti permintaanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tomonari, apa kau berbohong padaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.51,0:06:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak mengerti maksudmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, itu jawabanmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.86,0:06:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa artinya ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bawahanku mengambil foto ini tadi pagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.65,0:06:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang waktu itu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eum, itu, aku ada urusan\Ndi kediaman Konohana
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena keluarga kami saling kenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kuajukan pertanyaan lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat istirahat makan siang hari ini,\Nkau ada di mana dan bersama siapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.81,0:06:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah kau pergi ke tempat sepi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk menghabiskan waktu bersama Konohana?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.25,0:06:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan menganggap kebungkamanmu\Nsebagai jawaban "ya".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:07:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan kata lain, kau sudah mengkhianatiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak bermaksud mengkhianatimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.37,0:07:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Angkat pedangmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kuhancurkan dirimu dan hatimu\Nyang busuk itu berkeping-keping!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.19,0:07:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tu-Tunggu, Tennoji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Takkan kubiarkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kote!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.43,0:07:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tennoji benar-benar serius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau mempermainkanku selama ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Melihatku menganggap Konohana Hinako\Nsebagai sainganku,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kau pura-pura berada di pihakku,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sambil menertawakanku dari belakang!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}K-Kau salah paham!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku takkan pernah menertawakanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang benar aku berutang budi\Npada Keluarga Konohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi alasanku menghabiskan waktu\Ndenganmu, Tennoji,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.34,0:08:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah karena keinginanku sendiri,\Ntak ada kaitannya dengan Keluarga Konohana!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak butuh alasanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akui bahwa aku telah berbohong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga menyembunyikan banyak hal darimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi sumpah, aku melakukannya\Nbukan untuk menyakitimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana aku bisa memercayai\Nomonganmu lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu karena yang baru saja kukatakan\Nadalah kejujuran.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.65,0:08:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kubilang, aku tak bisa memercayaimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah kebenarannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.08,0:08:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuceritakan padanya semuanya\Ntentang situasiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahwa aku bukan pewaris perusahaan IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Melainkan aku bekerja\Ndi Keluarga Konohana sebagai pelayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.71,0:08:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun, aku tak memberitahunya\Ntentang sifat asli Hinako.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.55,0:08:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku paham sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.13,0:09:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kedengarannya tak masuk akal,\Ntapi semuanya jadi sinkron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penipu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau ini memang penipu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang benar apa yang kau bilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gaya bicaramu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa nada bicaramu itu juga cuma pura-pura?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.83,0:09:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bedanya kentara sekali\Ndengan suaramu yang dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurasa begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.95,0:09:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong bicara padaku\Ndengan gaya bahasamu yang asli.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gaya bahasaku yang asli?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.64,0:09:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bersumpahlah padaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.02,0:09:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai sekarang, jangan ada lagi kebohongan\Nsaat kau bersamaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik lewat ucapan maupun perbuatanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika kau memegang sumpah itu,\Naku akan memaafkanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau berbohong demi menyembunyikan\Njanjimu dengan Keluarga Konohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.43,0:09:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin ada kalanya kau terpaksa\Nmerahasiakan sesuatu dariku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi mulai sekarang,\Nkalau ada yang tak bisa kau ceritakan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.90,0:09:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jujur saja bilang begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah maksudku saat memintamu\Nuntuk tidak berbohong kepadaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mengerti.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku takkan pernah membohongimu lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar adil, aku juga takkan membohongimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepakat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak ada lagi dusta di antara kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.69,0:10:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Astaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau ini selalu saja bikin kejutan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.87,0:10:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan sejak pertama kali kita bertemu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.37,0:10:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tahu tentang Grup Konohana,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi sama sekali tak pernah dengar\Ntentang Grup Tennoji...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada-ada saja keanehanmu itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.34,0:10:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita sudahi hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita bisa kembali belajar bersama\Nmulai besok.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.38,0:10:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.07,0:10:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sesampainya nanti,\Naku harus melapor ke Shizune.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.82,0:10:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dipikir-pikir, karena sekarang\Nkau sudah tahu identitasku,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:11:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku mungkin takkan bisa\Nsekolah di sini lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baru saja pulang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat datang kembali, Tuan Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.73,0:11:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eum, Shizune,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku harus membicarakan sesuatu denganmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.99,0:11:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kebetulan sekali. Aku juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu ya. Aku memahami situasinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.43,0:11:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eum, apa yang akan terjadi\Npadaku setelah ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami baru saja menerima telepon\Ndari Nona Tennoji Mirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari Tennoji?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia memintaku untuk tidak menuntut\Npengunduran dirimu dari sekolah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Tennoji berkata\Nbahwa dia hilang kendali,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.25,0:11:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan karena kecurigaan yang tak beralasan,\Ndia telah melakukan sesuatu yang dia sesali.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.26,0:11:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia berjanji takkan memberitahukan\Nrahasia ini pada siapa pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.20,0:11:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sungguh pribadi yang sangat terhormat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan sampaikan pada Tuan Kagen\Ntentang semua kejadian ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.06,0:12:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa dibilang, Keluarga Konohana
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.07,0:12:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}takkan bisa begitu saja\Nmengabaikan permintaan putri Tennoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.14,0:12:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga merasa ikut andil\Natas terjadinya masalah ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin kelak\Nbeberapa tindakan pencegahan perlu diambil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.53,0:12:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, Nona...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau sampai kapan Anda berdiri di sana?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.41,0:12:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baru saja menjelaskan\Nringkasan kejadiannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang akan terjadi padamu, Itsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.19,0:12:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kau akan dipecat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, takkan begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.40,0:12:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.83,0:12:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bikin aku khawatir, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.39,0:12:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.65,0:12:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kenapa dia bisa tahu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kupikir aku tak seharusnya\Nterus berbohong pada Tennoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.59,0:12:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa tidak?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.93,0:12:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasa kalau Tennoji memercayaiku
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.19,0:12:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan aku pun memercayainya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.82,0:13:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau bodoh, Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.27,0:13:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.91,0:13:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shizune, apa mungkin\Ndia membenciku sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan begitu maksudnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.99,0:13:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus aku harus bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tennoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eum, terima kasih atas semua\Nbantuanmu kemarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa nada bicaramu begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.02,0:13:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih atas bantuanmu kemarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kudengar kau menelepon Keluarga Konohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak usah dipikirkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.63,0:13:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong,\Nmengingat semua yang sudah terjadi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.99,0:13:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bagaimana kalau kau mengganti\Ncara panggilmu padaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.69,0:13:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pas kita cuma berdua,\Naku tak keberatan kau panggil aku Mirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.35,0:13:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa tampangmu begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.25,0:13:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harusnya kau menganggapnya\Nsebagai sebuah kehormatan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.25,0:13:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ba-Baiklah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga akan panggil kau Itsuki\Nmulai sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anggap saja itu sebagai kode\Nuntukmu berbicara santai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.33,0:13:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:13:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.99,0:14:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.47,0:14:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mirei?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-A-Aku tarik kembali ucapanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bila kupanggil kau Itsuki,\Ntetaplah bicara santai denganku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.07,0:14:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan kembalilah panggil namaku\Nseperti semula.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.32,0:14:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejujurnya, aku diam-diam\Nmengamatimu sepanjang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.58,0:14:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau memang terlihat meyakinkan\Nberperan sebagai pelayan Konohana Hinako.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau selalu bersiaga di dekatnya\Nsecara diam-diam,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.12,0:14:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan selalu tanggap jika terjadi sesuatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Konohana Hinako sungguh wanita beruntung.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jujur saja, aku hampir\Ntak sanggup mengimbanginya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.66,0:14:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak usah merendah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.75,0:14:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jadi iri sekali...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, Itsuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.18,0:14:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa saja yang kau lakukan saat makan siang\Ndengan Konohana Hinako?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kulihat kalian masuk ke gedung OSIS lama\Nyang kosong secara terpisah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tanya ngapain?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami cuma makan siang bareng\Nlayaknya orang biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.55,0:15:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian bisa makan siang\Ndengan normal di kelas?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.43,0:15:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menolak berkomentar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.86,0:15:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.26,0:15:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kuperjelas sekali lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.27,0:15:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian tak melakukan hal yang aneh-aneh\Ndi sana, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurasa tidak begitu, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.17,0:15:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Merasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami tidak berbuat aneh-aneh, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.01,0:15:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasa-rasanya kalian berdua punya hubungan\Nyang lebih dari sekadar pelayan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.71,0:15:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Apa buktinya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Instingku!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.69,0:15:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Insting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.91,0:15:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, kalau dipikir-pikir...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.87,0:15:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dipikir-pikir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa dibilang aku lumayan dekat dengannya,\Nlebih dari sekadar hubungan pelayan biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}De-Dekat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.18,0:15:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sedekat apa yang sedang kita bicarakan ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.59,0:15:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misalnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:16:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami suka mengobrol soal banyak hal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, kalau itu sih, masih wajar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.35,0:16:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau juga sering begitu denganku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.55,0:16:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, kami makan bareng.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita juga sering makan bareng, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.44,0:16:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kadang aku menepuk kepalanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tak pernah melakukan hal itu padaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menepuk kepalanya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dalam situasi apa itu terjadi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Itu, biasanya situasinya memang\Nmengarah ke sana...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.82,0:16:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengarah ke sana bagaimana?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.75,0:16:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tepuk juga kepalaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.81,0:16:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pantang kalah\Ndari Konohana Hinako dalam hal apa pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.88,0:16:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pantang kalah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.91,0:16:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.27,0:16:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tennoji?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:17:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.14,0:17:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tadi aku lagi melamun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.83,0:17:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa aja.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.73,0:17:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini, kau harus mengerjakan kuis,\Nwaktunya lima menit per lembar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lima menit?\NWaktunya terlalu singkat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya kuisnya juga lumayan susah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau takkan mencapai targetmu\Nkalau tak bisa mengatasinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau terlalu lelet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tegakkan badanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jaga postur, jaga postur!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke-Kelihatannya kau lebih galak\Ndari biasanya, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.83,0:17:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku takkan bersikap lembek\Npada pembohong sepertimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak bisa menyangkalnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tidak apa-apa, Tomonari?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.79,0:17:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau kelihatannya agak pucat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami sudah dengar gosipnya, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:18:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau belajar bareng Tennoji\Ntiap pulang sekolah, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semangat, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.65,0:18:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.02,0:18:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan lupa istirahat juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau benar. Akan kuingat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhir-akhir ini Tennoji sering\Nmemasang ekspresi seperti itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, kita akhiri sampai di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ujian sudah dekat, jadi mari kita tunda dulu\Nlatihan dansa setelah hari ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan kita fokus ke pelajaran sekolah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu. Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daya tangkapmu ternyata lumayan cepat juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ngomong jujur, bukan basa-basi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahan yang umumnya dipelajari berhari-hari,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bisa kau kuasai cuma dalam sehari.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.98,0:18:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu karena aku juga mengulangnya di rumah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tampaknya aku mulai menyukai\Norang yang pekerja keras.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.37,0:18:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}J-Jangan salah paham!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:18:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudku, aku menghargai\Nkegigihan seseorang!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}O-Oh, maksudmu begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.56,0:19:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.23,0:19:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana mungkin aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana mungkin aku memikirkan hal lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ekspresi itu lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berhubung aku sudah mulai menceritakan\Nsoal masalah ini padamu,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.62,0:19:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}biar kujelaskan situasinya secara utuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Calon tunanganku itu\Nkebetulan tinggal lumayan jauh dari sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.79,0:19:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Supaya hubungan kami bisa berlanjut,\Naku harus pindah ke tempatnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.14,0:19:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika pertunangan kami diresmikan,\Naku harus keluar dari akademi ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tu-Tunggu sebentar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa mendadak begini?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bukan keinginanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.13,0:19:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah artinya menerima perjodohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menuruti keinginan keluarga dan berbakti\Nseutuhnya demi menyatukan kedua belah pihak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.70,0:19:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sudah jadi konsekuensinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi tetap saja...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya aku bertekad keras mengalahkan\NKonohana Hinako di ujian nanti.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.74,0:20:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan begitu, tak ada alasan lagi\Nbagiku untuk bertahan di akademi ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.15,0:20:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia memang berbeda dari Hinako dan Narika.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.81,0:20:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tennoji punya pendirian yang teguh\Ndan sanggup memendam perasaannya sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.94,0:20:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akibatnya, dia tak terbiasa meminta bantuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan pasang tampang murung begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.48,0:20:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya aku sudah pernah bilang?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa berkontribusi demi Keluarga Tennoji\Nitu kebahagiaan buatku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.55,0:20:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oleh karena itu, aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.09,0:20:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kau sungguhan merasa begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.60,0:20:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kuungkapkan dengan kalimat lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah tanya berkali-kali,\Ntapi akan kutanyakan lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.26,0:20:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kau benar-benar rela\Ndengan perjodohan ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita sudah janji\Ntakkan ada kebohongan lagi, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menolak berkomentar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diammu itu secara tersirat\Nsudah memberikan jawaban.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tennoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.43,0:21:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tumben nadamu terdengar serius?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa besok kau ada waktu luang,\Nmengingat besok hari libur?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.71,0:21:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau pernah bilang\Nkau diadopsi sejak masih kecil.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.30,0:21:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu berarti, kau tak tahu apa pun\Nsoal kehidupan rakyat biasa sepertiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kau tak penasaran?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.11,0:21:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bohong kalau bilang\Naku tak penasaran sama sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.32,0:21:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi sekarang ini, prioritasku\Nadalah menumbangkan Konohana Hinako.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena ini mungkin kesempatan terakhirku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.67,0:21:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski begitu, tubuhmu juga perlu istirahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin membalas kebaikanmu selama ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.22,0:21:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi biar kutunjukkan padamu\Nbagaimana cara rakyat jelata bersantai.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.91,0:22:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin kau benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.27,0:22:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, dengan senang hati\Nkuterima tawaranmu.
